Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:49:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] SessionManager: add Running Terminals dock for tmux and
 screen sessions

Lists the sessions of the local machine and of ssh hosts. A session opens in a
new tab, can be created, renamed, ended or moved from another viewer. Only the
tools found installed on a host are offered.
